#==============================================================================================
#
#   tests_skia_reference_data - pixels DisplayListPlayerSkia renders for the player tests
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Test vectors: for each scene of tests_cpu_player.lucb, the premultiplied pixels
#       (0xAARRGGBB per pixel, rows top to bottom) that Ladybird's DisplayListPlayerSkia
#       (Skia) renders for the same display list, recorded locally from the reference build
#       of Ladybird 47c82b38d0. The CPU player is compared with them under Ladybird's fuzzy
#       reftest rule (a maximum channel difference and a number of differing pixels).
#
#==============================================================================================

